      "fact": "Five vertical bars are shown, each with a percentage label centered above it. Bar heights increase left-to-right to the second bar, then decrease, with the second bar (Groundwater) being the tallest."
    },
    {
      "location": "bar 1 (Surface water)",
      "fact": "Light blue bar; top aligns just above the 40 tick; label '41.2%' sits above it."
    },
    {
      "location": "bar 2 (Groundwater)",
      "fact": "Teal/mint bar; top aligns just below the 70 tick; label '29.8%' sits above it. This is the tallest bar on the page."
    },
    {
      "location": "bar 3 (Desalination)",
      "fact": "Blue/indigo bar; top aligns just above the 50 tick; label '18.5%' sits above it."
    }
  ],
