    "The printed numeric annotations (e.g., '41.2%' for Surface water, '29.8%' for Groundwater) do not match the visual bar heights on the y-axis (Surface water bar reaches ~41, Groundwater bar reaches ~68). It is unclear whether the labels or the bar heights represent the true 'contribution' values.",
    "The task asks for the 'largest urban water-supply contribution source'. Based on bar height, Groundwater is largest. Based on printed labels, Surface water (41.2%) is largest. This conflict is unresolved from the image alone."
  ]
